    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d461">

                <pb facs="0615" n="604" sameAs="frus:frus1937v02/pg604"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">890H.6363/90: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Iran</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Merriam</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-04-24T12:00:00+03:25">April 24,
                        1937—noon.</date><lb/>[Received April 24—11:25 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>18. Hart confirms that petroleum concession has been ratified by the Afghan
                        Parliament.<anchor n="6" xml:id="d461-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Merriam</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d461-f1" n="6" xml:id="d461-f1-content">
                <p>In telegram No. 74, June 21, 1938, 9 p.m., the Chargé in Iran reported to the
                    Department that on June 19, 1938, Mr. Hart had given the Afghan Government
                    written notice of the cancellation of this concession (890H.6363/104).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
